{
  "note": "Synthetic, obviously-fake test fixtures for direct RuleEvaluationEngine verification of the real-corpus rules DS-01..DS-05 (data/rulebook.json). Not real transactions, not real customers. Loaded via agents.loader.load_fixture_set().",
